# Husky hooks run under sh (also Git for Windows); CRLF breaks them
.husky/* text eol=lf

# Store LF in the repo and check out LF on every platform. Without this,
# Windows (core.autocrlf=true) rewrites these files to CRLF on save and the
# next commit looks like a phantom diff of the whole file.
* text=auto eol=lf
